WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:02,740
It's okay. I can't remember the loss.

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,700
Finally woke up

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,180
There is water in your majesty

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,900
There's river rice here, so go away

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,220
This is what I drank first

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,060
I have a card. I'll go first.

7
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,380
Let me take a sip too

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,100
I'm almost knocked to death

9
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:22,870
Parents, what are you doing?

10
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:24,190
Don't forget where this is

11
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:25,470
Wang Xuewei Wang Yi

12
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:26,950
Li Qiang, pull those people away

13
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,000
You are here to look for hotel supplies.

14
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,320
Or were they used as a robber machine to rob?

15
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,920
Yes, we are here to pay compensation to Boss Xia.

16
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,280
Aren't you ready to live like this?

17
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,640
Boss Xia, I'm so sorry

18
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,120
This happened as soon as I arrived

19
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,720
But the people over there are not from our team.

20
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,320
Boss Xia can handle it however he wants.
